                <pb facs="0684" n="612" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg612"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4832/76.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Special Commissioner Buchanan to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Willemstadt</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-12-31"><hi rendition="#italic">December 31,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Buchanan says that, accompanied by the Brazilian minister, he called upon the
                    Venezuelan minister for foreign affairs, to whom he presented a copy of his
                    commission, and also delivered to him the communication addressed to him by
                    Secretary Root. Mr. Buchanan adds that the conferences were expected to begin on
                    the following day.</p>
            </div>
